      "marker": "/usr/local/var/cyclotron/tmp.noindex/cyclotron-28a4cdc2/extract/bb44cf/payload/Library/Application Support/Installer.app/Contents/MacOS/Installer.MALICIOUS",
      "marker_note": "Installer stealer: phishes and exfiltrates; add Documents listing",
      "analysis": {
        "identity": "Universal Mach-O C++ state-XOR wrapper executing an AppleScript information stealer",
        "evidence": [
          "ARM64 entry decodes the command, obtains its C string and calls system().",
          "Independent decoding of both 37,077-byte ciphertexts agrees exactly: seed 0x11667; state = ((state * 0x3785) & 0xffffffff) % 35999. Modulus is derived from embedded 09:59:59.",
          "AppleScript checks a cached login password or requests a hidden-answer Installation dialog, validates it with dscl . authonly, caches and stages the password.",
          "Copies Chromium/Gecko login, cookie and wallet-extension stores, desktop wallets, Keychain databases, Notes databases/media and selected Desktop/Documents files; falls back to Notes property export.",
          "Archives its staging tree using ditto and posts /tmp/out.zip to an HTTP endpoint, then deletes the staging tree and ZIP.",
          "Downloads a Ledger Live replacement, terminates Ledger Live, removes its bundle using the captured password and sudo, and unzips the replacement into /Applications.",
          "Fetches a command for a KeepAlive/RunAtLoad LaunchDaemon, installs it with sudo and bootstraps it; a nohup fallback is present."
        ],
        "judgment_reason": "Installer disguise coupled with validated password capture, linked credential collection/upload, wallet replacement and durable remote-command activation establishes malicious intent.",
        "limits": [
          "Runtime success and the bytes of remote payloads were not observed.",
          "The upload retry omits an argument on recursion; ten successful retries cannot be asserted."
        ]
      }
    },
